    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "vim-patch:9.0.2172: Vim9: compiling :defer may fail\r\n\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/src/version.c b/src/version.c\r\nindex de90fcec5..213a0e7c2 100644\r\n--- a/src/version.c\r\n+++ b/src/version.c\r\n@@ -705,7 +705,7 @@ static char *(features[]) =\r\n static int included_patches[] =\r\n {   /* Add new patch number below this line */\r\n /**/\r\n-    2171,\r\n+    2172,\r\n /**/\r\n     2170,\r\n /**/\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis mistake rarely happens. Last time was v8.1.0744 .\r\n\r\n```\r\n    patch 8.1.0744: compiler warnings for signed/unsigned strings\r\n```",
